{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42263","headline":"又和萧少卿见庆新居 · 徐铉","name":"又和萧少卿见庆新居","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"惊蓬偶驻知多幸，断雁重联惬素期。\n当户小山如旧识，上墙幽藓最相宜。\n清风不去因栽竹，隙地无多也凿池。\n更喜良邻有嘉树，绿阴分得近南枝。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐铉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42263.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42263","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}